// The Sunken Library (bible 4.3, 8.3 [F 5.1]): an anchored library; Brother Ansel has read page 214 for thirty-eight
// years. The book is a history of the Halloways (5.4). Turn the page and he forgets the thirty-eight years.
// Library_2. Teodor will not turn it; he tells her so at the reading stair (Library_1).

title: Library_Teodor_Ansel
---
Teodor: He is reading. He has been reading for thirty-eight years. He is happy on that page. #line:0591338
Teodor: I will not turn it for you. May I say a thing you will not like? Neither should you. #plant:5.1 #line:0943384
<<flag verdance.library.teodor_asked 1>>
===

title: Library_Ansel
---
<<if has_flag("verdance.library.page_turned")>>
    Ansel: Two hundred and fifteen. The owl had a daughter. I never knew that. Did you? #plant:5.4 #still #line:0129db3
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("verdance.library.decided")>>
    Ansel: Two hundred and fourteen. A marvellous page. I have only just begun it. #still #line:01d6f86
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Ansel: Two hundred and fourteen. A marvellous page. I have only just begun it. #line:0578ee2
Ansel: A history of the Halloways. The owl who kept the Atlas. It is very good about his family. #plant:5.4 #line:0c8eec4
Ansel: I am coming to the part about his daughter. Any moment now. #line:0a7e0a7
-> What's on the next page? #line:02db988
    Ansel: I do not know. That is the pleasure of it. I will know soon. #line:0969c72
-> Can I turn it for you? #line:00508c3
    Ansel: Would you? My wings are so tired. I have been holding it open a little while. #line:066683c
    <<jump Library_Ansel_Turn>>
-> ... #line:0905727
    Ansel: Yes. Quiet. It is a library. #line:0bca10e
<<flag verdance.library.decided 2>>
===

title: Library_Ansel_Turn
---
-> Turn the page. #line:0cf8ed5
    Ansel: Oh. Oh. Two hundred and fifteen. #line:036c808
    Ansel: Where is everyone? It was morning. Who are you? Who has let the dust in? #line:018ab29
    <<flag verdance.library.page_turned 1>>
    <<flag verdance.library.decided 1>>
-> Leave it where it is. #line:0e260cb
    Ansel: Kind of you. Another time. There is no hurry. There never is, down here. #line:03f08c5
    <<flag verdance.library.decided 2>>
